# This is the capture tool's output tree. Captures are large, numerous, and
# rewritten by every run, so they are not committed.
#
# A capture a TEST reads is therefore not allowed to live here: it would be
# invisible to every clone but the one that took it, which is exactly how the
# shaping regression gate came to be green on one machine only (GIT_80).
# Test fixtures live in packages/ui/test/fixtures/, tracked, where this file
# cannot reach them and the capture tool does not write.
runs/**/*.csv
